{"version":3,"kind":"Notebook","sha256":"b3f4e65bd913b885851d19014190000349d64300684eae394b6249b7a100159c","slug":"spatial.introduction","location":"/spatial/introduction.ipynb","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"空间解析的单细胞数据","authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Anna Schaar","given":"Anna","family":"Schaar"},"name":"Anna Schaar","id":"contributors-introduction-generated-uid-0"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Lukas Heumos","given":"Lukas","family":"Heumos"},"name":"Lukas Heumos","roles":["Writing – review & editing"],"id":"contributors-introduction-generated-uid-1"}],"content_includes_title":false,"kernelspec":{"name":"cell2loc_env","display_name":"Environment (cell2loc_env)","language":"python"},"github":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices","settings":{"output_matplotlib_strings":"remove"},"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/blob/main/.build/v2-candidate/community-notice-2026-09-16-02/overlay/spatial/introduction.ipynb","edit_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/edit/main/.build/v2-candidate/community-notice-2026-09-16-02/overlay/spatial/introduction.ipynb","thumbnail":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/introduction_1-819d3c6672cd03561385611020b4137d.jpeg","exports":[{"format":"ipynb","filename":"introduction.ipynb","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/introduction-671d17001f8b1f8566f37f5fbfd48a02.ipynb"}]},"widgets":{},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"details","children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🧠 关键要点","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"tMiITYFuuq"}],"key":"Md7c1ttaxz"},{"type":"crossReference","url":"/spatial/introduction","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"空间分辨组学（spatially resolved omics）在测量分子特征（feature）的同时保留空间位置。多细胞、单细胞与亚细胞分辨率各有适用问题；不同技术在测量覆盖、捕获效率和分辨率之间存在取舍。","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"Wjn503c5LC"}],"key":"IfSlNQbQk0"}],"urlSource":"/spatial/introduction#spatial-introduction-key-takeaway-1","dataUrl":"/spatial.introduction.json","identifier":"spatial-introduction-key-takeaway-1","label":"spatial-introduction-key-takeaway-1","remote":true,"protocol":"file","kind":"heading","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"spatial-introduction-key-takeaway-1","key":"SYA1e0bsKi"}],"key":"OdMfKCggDn"},{"type":"comment","value":" END DROPDOWNS ","key":"NRLYMXAGdc"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"研究动机","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"uue27arIb9"}],"label":"spatial-introduction-key-takeaway-1","identifier":"spatial-introduction-key-takeaway-1","html_id":"spatial-introduction-key-takeaway-1","key":"KMgYaFiKGE"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"bulk 和单细胞组学技术使我们能够在基因组尺度上研究细胞身份及其相关因素。此前介绍的单细胞测量主要针对从组织中解离的细胞，因此丢失了细胞和分子在原组织中的位置关系，而这些信息对许多生物学问题至关重要。空间分辨组学（spatially resolved omics）在测量分子特征（feature）的同时保留空间位置，为研究组织结构与功能提供了补充。","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"Qk5GQzJAux"}],"key":"VM3ZAdyNjk"}],"key":"F397CLX8aZ"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"空间组学测量技术概览","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"tggpxDMEWb"}],"identifier":"overview-of-spatial-profiling-measurements","label":"Overview of spatial profiling measurements","html_id":"overview-of-spatial-profiling-measurements","implicit":true,"key":"ommDtGcwbX"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"空间组学可测量转录组（transcriptome）、蛋白质组（proteome）或染色质可及性（chromatin accessibility）。不同技术在测量规模、分辨率、灵敏度、多重检测能力和适用样本方面各有取舍。这个领域发展迅速，本章仅按捕获分辨率概述三类技术；更详细的比较可参阅后附综述。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"tiR458yplz"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"spat:moffitt_emerging_2022","identifier":"spat:moffitt_emerging_2022","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Moffitt ","key":"r3A5eqMMSO"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"F01hyx37QR"}],"key":"tP7o4wN9VX"},{"type":"text","value":", 2022","key":"GJIbrvuBI8"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"z61RrYt2OS"}],"key":"kiNPv6DFlf"},{"type":"text","value":" ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"O6UwYPgsHv"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"spat:walker_deciphering_2022","identifier":"spat:walker_deciphering_2022","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Walker ","key":"Vx4JyPB4nL"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"Zau4oeUutJ"}],"key":"AESGN5eHNh"},{"type":"text","value":", 2022","key":"x6uDApvAoS"}],"enumerator":"2","key":"iwkJFyujjS"}],"key":"Vyyk6JGgvV"},{"type":"text","value":" ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"gY518Xlyxa"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"spat:yue_guidebook_2023","identifier":"spat:yue_guidebook_2023","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Yue ","key":"rut4fetguu"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"uQrkQfX07m"}],"key":"BbvMiog7fJ"},{"type":"text","value":", 2023","key":"WO6gFJuNly"}],"enumerator":"3","key":"n9KPFr49ul"}],"key":"ZoddrW4LDe"}],"key":"g9Lh9ZQfRa"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/introduction_1-819d3c6672cd03561385611020b4137d.jpeg","alt":"空间组学的多细胞、单细胞与亚细胞分辨率","width":"800px","key":"H8Ifo5SGob","urlSource":"../_static/images/spatial/introduction_1.jpeg"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"captionNumber","kind":"figure","label":"resolutions","identifier":"resolutions","html_id":"resolutions","enumerator":"1","children":[{"type":"text","value":"图 ","key":"LLLxDVGnWd"},{"type":"text","value":"1","key":"WQYmjO98Cy"},{"type":"text","value":"：","key":"G3JQxEpdKT"}],"template":"图 %s：","key":"dRQsHLq0vG"},{"type":"text","value":"空间组学数据可具有多细胞、单细胞或亚细胞分辨率。","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"mrXyfYjrCV"}],"key":"cngIHu6Y9q"}],"key":"bk78y9bO8V"}],"class":"bg-primary mb-1","label":"resolutions","identifier":"resolutions","enumerator":"1","html_id":"resolutions","key":"lfw7DGAA4V"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"下面按多细胞、单细胞和亚细胞三个尺度介绍代表性技术及其优势与局限。这些分类描述测量尺度，实际获得的细胞分辨率还取决于分子捕获和后续处理。","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"VtTOWycuKo"}],"key":"kzk8JXnvmR"}],"key":"kqDRRzlcOS"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"多细胞分辨率","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"nVCXl4AcJe"}],"identifier":"multi-cell-resolution","label":"Multi-cell resolution","html_id":"multi-cell-resolution","implicit":true,"key":"QHh2dknSI3"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"多细胞分辨率下，一个捕获点（spot）通常混合了多个细胞的分子信号。不同 spot 包含的细胞数和细胞类型可能不同。去卷积（deconvolution）方法可据此估计各 spot 的细胞类型组成，但不能直接恢复每个细胞的精确位置。","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"YXYUUOVROQ"}],"key":"zs6ZxcvSPI"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这类技术通常覆盖全转录组。原文列举的常规 Visium 捕获点直径约为 55 µm，Slide-seq 微珠直径约为 10 µm；这些是具体平台的捕获尺度，不代表所有空间技术的固定分辨率范围。后续教程将用 10x Genomics 的 Visium 数据演示分析与去卷积。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"kMBfi0vlc0"}],"key":"svQZZjuxNy"}],"key":"c2kzzZzxqv"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞分辨率","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"UYPC47H5Po"}],"identifier":"single-cell-resolution","label":"Single-cell resolution","html_id":"single-cell-resolution","implicit":true,"key":"cyiiwZW0YG"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞尺度的空间组学既可直接定位细胞，也可通过大小接近或小于细胞的捕获单元获取信号。高清空间转录组测序（high-definition spatial transcriptomics, HDST）、Slide-seqV2 和 Stereo-seq 属于后者，能够覆盖全转录组，但分子捕获效率仍有限。捕获单元足够小并不自动意味着每个观测都对应完整的单个细胞，还需结合分割或信号汇总。","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"j1KrJcMJLo"}],"key":"OTgNkJjhxL"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"靶向测量（targeted profiling）提供了另一条路线：通过成像定位预先选定的分子。代表方法包括多重纠错荧光原位杂交（Multiplexed Error-Robust Fluorescence In Situ Hybridization, MERFISH）、seqFISH+、成像质谱流式技术（Imaging Mass Cytometry, IMC），以及多重免疫组织化学（Immunohistochemistry, IHC）相关方法，如 CyCIF 和 CODEX。这些技术测量预设的 feature 面板，通常成本较高。与预设捕获点网格不同，它们定位的是具体转录本、蛋白质信号或细胞。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"kmijAJyJ4e"}],"key":"b9hIXNHd5S"}],"key":"r1u0e57sUD"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"亚细胞分辨率","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"oW2QSxzkup"}],"identifier":"sub-cellular-resolution","label":"Sub-cellular resolution","html_id":"sub-cellular-resolution","implicit":true,"key":"zehz6sSlii"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"亚细胞分辨率的空间转录组数据可定位 RNA 分子，或将其定位到小于细胞的捕获区域。前者可由单分子成像获得，后者可通过空间条形码（Barcode）实现。对这些数据进行细胞分割（cell segmentation）后，可将分子信号汇总到各个细胞，形成单细胞表达矩阵，再进入结合空间信息的分析流程（pipeline）。后文将以 MERFISH 数据演示相关分析。","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"lDP3IYEQQk"}],"key":"K76RCnpBTI"}],"key":"H6C5cjAE34"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"推荐阅读","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"E50dKGT8TP"}],"identifier":"recommended-reading","label":"Recommended reading","html_id":"recommended-reading","implicit":true,"key":"shNu8m4tVq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"以下论文有助于进一步理解不同空间测量技术之间的差异：","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"SaejBDdCm8"}],"key":"v1rYlC1ijg"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The emerging landscape of spatial profiling technologies ","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}